OpenMacFUSE was written from the public specifications RFC 7530, RFC 7531,
RFC 5531 and RFC 4506 and the public FUSE 2.x high-level API description.
It contains no third-party source code.

"FUSE" refers to the Filesystem in Userspace API. OpenMacFUSE is an independent
project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by macFUSE or its authors,
